>
>Something definately needs to be done about wands of sleep..
>When One (count him) green elf can off a 14th level Valkyrie
>(with 124Hp and an AC of -18) just by zapping a wand of sleep
>and then calmly shaving her to death by 1-2 hp a time
>all is not well.

I agree...  I just got my valk offed by an ogre with a cheap sword...
You'd think after getting hit 10 or 12 times anybody would wake up.
I say there should be a percent chance of waking each time you get
hit on top of the normal sleep/wake up procedure.  I may implement
that myself in my copy, but it really should be part of the game.

While we're on pet peeves, I'd like to complain about instantly fatal
poison...  I had a 7th level valkyrie who hadn't gotten poison resistance.
She got level teleported, so I was running down to find a tripe ration
to give to the pooch so we could be friends again.  As I'm running about,
up walks a giant spider.  Next thing I know, I've been fatally poisoned!
I had 80 hp!   This is way out of line here...

